# Jars that unused-jar-candidates.py finds unreferenced but that are
# known to be loaded at run time by a name it cannot see (built by string
# concatenation, set in configuration outside the archive, loaded by
# JNI). Listed jars move from "candidates" to "keep-listed" in the dry-run
# report. One g:a per line, with the reason after '#':
#
#   org.example:loaded-by-name  # set by <config key> in <file>
#
# A row that names no shipped jar, or a jar the scan finds referenced
# anyway, is reported as stale: remove it.
